  m_text: "<color=#FFD700><b>H\u01AF\u1EDANG D\u1EAAN K\u1EF8 N\u0102NG & PH\xCDM
    T\u1EAET:</b></color>\n<color=#5ce1e6>[A/D / M\u0169i t\xEAn]</color> Di chuy\u1EC3n 
    |  <color=#5ce1e6>[Space]</color> Nh\u1EA3y / Nh\u1EA3y \u0111\xF4i / B\xE1m
    t\u01B0\u1EDDng\n<color=#5ce1e6>[J / Chu\u1ED9t Tr\xE1i]</color> Ch\xE9m Ki\u1EBFm
    (Combo 3 \u0111\xF2n)  |  <color=#5ce1e6>[W + J]</color> Ch\xE9m H\u1EA5t L\xEAn\n<color=#5ce1e6>[S
    + J tr\xEAn kh\xF4ng]</color> Pogo Ch\xE9m Xu\u1ED1ng \u0110\u1EA9y N\u1EA3y 
    |  <color=#5ce1e6>[F]</color> Ph\u1EA3n \u0110\xF2n (Parry)\n<color=#5ce1e6>[K
    / Chu\u1ED9t Ph\u1EA3i]</color> Ki\u1EBFm Kh\xED N\u0103ng L\u01B0\u1EE3ng (30
    MP)  |  <color=#5ce1e6>[Shift / Q]</color> Shadow Dash\n<color=#5ce1e6>[R / X]</color>
